From: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 24 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: eip93: fix request lifetime and completion handling

Import and combine the proposed six-patch EIP-93 request lifetime and
completion handling series.  The fixes make request IDs failure-safe, keep
mutable SA records request-local, order descriptor reads after DMA ownership
changes, guard cleanup of partially initialized DMA mappings, reject unkeyed
HMAC requests, and fail probe when IRQ registration fails.

This is a prerequisite for reliable EIP-93 IPsec ESP operation.  Adapt the
request-local skcipher change to preserve OpenWrt's small-request AES
software fallback.

Link: https://lkml.iu.edu/2605.3/00413.html
Signed-off-by: Jihong Min <hurryman2212@gmail.com>
[SurNet: combine the series and adapt it after patch 926.]
Signed-off-by: SurNet <surnet@localhost>
---

